{"seq":1,"slug":"motion-matching","title":"动作匹配与运动场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/advanced-runtime/motion-matching","wordCount":1423,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"动作匹配与运动场\">动作匹配与运动场</h1><p><a href=\"../playback-blending/state-machines\">动画状态机</a> 末尾留下一个尖锐问题：自然移动一旦加上加速、急停、转身、地形适配，状态与转换就组合爆炸成意大利面。动作匹配（Motion Matching）给出的答案是颠覆性的——干脆不要手搭状态机和混合树，把成百上千段动捕摊成一个庞大的运动库，每帧实时从库里检索出与&quot;当前正在发生 + 玩家想要发生&quot;最贴合的那一帧，跳过去接着播。它是近十年来角色移动动画最重要的范式转移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动作匹配每帧做一件事：构造一个描述当前需求的<strong>查询特征向量</strong>，在预先从全部动画里抽取的<strong>特征数据库</strong>中找最近邻，跳转到那一帧并播放一小段，下一帧再重新查询。特征同时编码&quot;当前姿态/速度&quot;（保证连续不跳变）与&quot;期望未来轨迹&quot;（响应玩家意图）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[海量动捕&lt;br/&gt;无需切片成状态] --&gt; B[离线抽取特征&lt;br/&gt;每帧一条特征向量]&#10;  B --&gt; C[特征数据库]&#10;  D[当前姿态/速度] --&gt; E[构造查询向量]&#10;  F[玩家输入&lt;br/&gt;期望未来轨迹] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; G[在数据库中找最近邻]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[跳转到该帧并播放]&#10;  H --&gt;|下一帧重新查询| E\">flowchart TD\n  A[海量动捕&lt;br/&gt;无需切片成状态] --&gt; B[离线抽取特征&lt;br/&gt;每帧一条特征向量]\n  B --&gt; C[特征数据库]\n  D[当前姿态/速度] --&gt; E[构造查询向量]\n  F[玩家输入&lt;br/&gt;期望未来轨迹] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; G[在数据库中找最近邻]\n  C --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[跳转到该帧并播放]\n  H --&gt;|下一帧重新查询| E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征类别</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>当前姿态特征</td>\n<td>关键骨（脚/髋）位置与速度</td>\n<td>保证跳转后姿态连续不突变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期望轨迹特征</td>\n<td>未来若干时刻的位置/朝向</td>\n<td>让运动响应玩家意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前轨迹特征</td>\n<td>过去/当下的运动轨迹</td>\n<td>与期望轨迹比较选转向片段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"匹配的数学\">匹配的数学</h2><p>把特征拼成一个向量，匹配就是在数据库中找与查询向量距离最小的条目。设查询向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、库中第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{f}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每维带权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（统一不同物理量纲、调节各特征重要性），代价</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(i) = \\sum_{j} w_j\\,(q_j - f_{ij})^2, \\qquad i^\\star = \\arg\\min_i \\text{cost}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1502em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋆</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4777em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是手感调校的核心：加大&quot;期望轨迹&quot;权重让角色更跟手但可能牺牲流畅，加大&quot;当前姿态&quot;权重让过渡更顺但响应更钝。轨迹特征来自玩家输入预测出的未来路径——这里&quot;期望轨迹&quot;如何生成，与 <a href=\"../foundations/animation-principles\">动画原理与帧率</a> 里根运动 vs 原地循环的选择直接相关：根运动项目用动画自带位移、原地项目用代码推进胶囊，二者预测轨迹的方式不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暴力检索的代价与加速\">暴力检索的代价与加速</h2><p>朴素动作匹配每帧对整个数据库做一次线性扫描。库有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条、特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 维，单帧代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\cdot D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。一个含数小时动捕的库轻松到几十万条，每帧几十万次距离计算对 CPU 是实打实的负担——这把成本问题直接推给 <a href=\"performance-lod\">性能优化与动画 LOD</a>，远处角色往往降低查询频率或退回简单混合。常见加速：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>降低查询频率</strong>：不必每帧查，每 5~10 帧查一次、之间正常播放（库本身就连续）。</li>\n<li><strong>空间剖分/KD 树</strong>：对特征空间建索引，把最近邻从线性扫描降到近似对数。</li>\n<li><strong>数据库裁剪</strong>：去掉冗余、永远不会被选中的帧。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"学习式动作匹配-lmm\">学习式动作匹配 LMM</h2><p>动作匹配最大的工程负担是内存：原始动画 + 特征数据库可能占数百 MB，对主机和移动端都重。Ubisoft La Forge 在 2020 年 SIGGRAPH 提出<strong>学习式动作匹配（Learned Motion Matching, LMM）</strong>，用三个神经网络替换显式数据库：Stepper 网络预测下一帧的特征、Decompressor 网络从压缩特征还原完整姿态、Projector 网络在需要时把查询投影回最近的合法特征。它保留了动作匹配的灵活性、可预测性与画质，却把内存占用压缩到一个数量级以下，因此能扩展到远超手工方法的数据规模——这是&quot;传统检索&quot;与&quot;神经网络生成&quot;的一次成功调和，也是当前学术与工业的活跃方向（2025 年仍有用 Lipschitz 连续网络与稀疏专家混合提升其稳定性与速度的新工作）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>经典动作匹配</th>\n<th>学习式动作匹配 LMM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据存储</td>\n<td>显式特征 + 动画数据库</td>\n<td>神经网络权重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>高（数百 MB 级）</td>\n<td>低（约一个数量级以下）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行成本</td>\n<td>每帧最近邻检索</td>\n<td>每帧网络前向推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展数据量</td>\n<td>受内存限制</td>\n<td>远更大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可预测性/画质</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>基本保留</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工业现状与适用边界\">工业现状与适用边界</h2><p>截至 2026，动作匹配已是 3A 角色移动的事实标准之一：UE 自 5.4 起提供官方的 Motion Matching 插件与可下载的 Game Animation Sample 工程（内含一套动捕库与示例 MetaHuman，覆盖多种体型），5.6 进一步把它与 MetaHuman 整合，让任何项目都能快速接入。但动作匹配不是银弹：它吃海量高质量动捕（中小团队成本高）、调权重需要经验、且不适合高度风格化或需精确逐帧控制的动作（技能、连招仍归状态机）。主流架构因此是<strong>混合</strong>的——移动层用动作匹配、技能层用 <a href=\"../playback-blending/state-machines\">动画状态机</a>，二者通过分层叠加协作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>动作匹配每帧从海量动捕库检索最贴合&quot;当前 + 期望&quot;的帧，取代手搭状态机/混合树。</li>\n<li>特征 = 当前姿态（保连续）+ 期望/当前轨迹（保响应）；按权重最近邻匹配。</li>\n<li>暴力检索 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\cdot D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 昂贵，靠降频、KD 树索引、库裁剪加速。</li>\n<li>LMM 用三网络（Stepper/Decompressor/Projector）替换数据库，内存降一个数量级。</li>\n<li>2026 年是 3A 移动事实标准（UE 官方插件 + 样本工程），但吃动捕、调权重，常与状态机混合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动作匹配与运动场","id":"动作匹配与运动场"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配的数学","id":"匹配的数学"},{"level":2,"text":"暴力检索的代价与加速","id":"暴力检索的代价与加速"},{"level":2,"text":"学习式动作匹配 LMM","id":"学习式动作匹配-lmm"},{"level":2,"text":"工业现状与适用边界","id":"工业现状与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"物理与布偶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/physics-ragdoll"},"next":{"title":"面部动画与口型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/advanced-runtime/facial-lipsync"}}